          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ardonna",
            text: _("Just a little farther."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Ras-Tabahn",
            x: 10,
            y: 4,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ras-Tabahn",
            text: _("Ardryn-Na, I’m dying. (<i>Cough, cough</i>) I don’t think... I can stop it."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ardonna",
            text: _("Nor should you! You must embrace it. Crelanu said as much. He also said your life force must depart, but he didn’t say it could not come back to you!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ras-Tabahn",
            text: _("What are you... proposing?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ardonna",
            text: _("That you project your will into another object so that it is part of you — your staff for example. If you do this just as your body dies, your whole consciousness should follow the flow of your will, as it will have no other place to go."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ras-Tabahn",
            text: _("Well, it could go to the... lands of the dead. But... if I had an altar... the stone would serve to anchor me (<i>cough, cough, cough</i>) to this plane... and stop the downward flow of my soul... for just a moment."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ardonna",
            text: _("And a moment is all you need! You only need project your will <i>back</i> into your body, animating it as you would anything else!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ras-Tabahn",
            text: _("You seem... more sure than I, but (<i>cough, cough</i>) I have no choice."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ardonna",
            text: _("Crelanu said he wouldn’t do it. That implies that he <i>could</i>, so he also believed that it would work. And like you said, he should know. For now, you can rest. We’ll have an altar built soon."),
          },
